@iron_front_buildup
title: 壮大铁前线
subtitle: 加强宣传,为国旗团招募更多成员。
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : 距下次顾问行动还有 [+ advisor_action_timer +] 个月。 ?][? if iron_front_formed == 0 : 铁前线尚未组建。 ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; rb_strength += 200*workers_spd/(workers_spd+workers_kpd+workers_nsdap+workers_z+workers_dnvp+workers_other);

我们为国旗团招募了更多成员。


@form_iron_front
title: 组建铁前线
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and iron_front_formed == 0 and nazi_urgency >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : 距下次顾问行动还有 [+ advisor_action_timer +] 个月。 ?][? if iron_front_formed : 铁前线已经组建。 ?][? if nazi_urgency < 2 : 党还没有意识到纳粹的危险。 ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; rb_strength += 50; nazi_urgency += 1
go-to: confronting_nazis.iron_front 


@nazi_urgency
title: 警示纳粹的危险
subtitle: 通过向党警示纳粹的危险,我们可以促使党员行动起来。
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : 距下次顾问行动还有 [+ advisor_action_timer +] 个月。 ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nazi_urgency += 1; rb_militancy += 0.01; nsdap_workers -= 4*(1-dissent);

我们发起了一场宣传运动,警示党员远离纳粹。
